# CADDY_WWW_REDIRECT=off: no `www.<DOMAIN>` site, so Caddy requests no
# certificate for it and it needs no DNS record. This snippet adds nothing; it
# exists so the Caddyfile's
# `import /etc/caddy/deploy/www-redirect-{$CADDY_WWW_REDIRECT:on}.caddy`
# resolves to a file in every mode. The alternative is `www-redirect-on.caddy`.
